  "text": "Sum of Squares Error Sum of Squares Error In linear regression, the sum of squares error is the sum of squared errors of prediction. In analysis of variance , it is the sum of squared deviations from cell means for between-subjects factors and the Subjects x Treatment interaction for within-subject factors .",
